  description: 'If all monsters you control are "Superheavy Samurai" monsters, and
    you have no Spell/Trap Cards in your Graveyard: You can target 1 face-up monster
    your opponent controls that has a Level; send both it and this card from the
    field to the Graveyard, then Special Summon from your Extra Deck 1 "Superheavy
    Samurai" Synchro Monster whose Level equals the total original Levels of those
    2 monsters in the Graveyard. (This Special Summon is treated as a Synchro Summon.)
    You can only use this effect of "Superheavy Samurai Battleball" once per turn.'
